  "observations": [
    "All six light/dark minimum empty views show the composer, send control, selectors and saved-input indication.",
    "All six minimum attachment/long-input views show the PDF attachment, remove control, input and send control. At larger zoom the composer and tool row need scrolling; the complete input and all tools are not simultaneously visible.",
    "The dark PDF view shows page 2 of 2, Budget 42, page/zoom/search controls and both footer actions. This image does not establish every PDF page or every theme/zoom.",
    "All six minimum conversation views retain the unsent handoff draft and send control; larger zoom requires message scrolling to see the stopped response and usage.",
    "All six regular-size conversation views show the stopped response and handoff draft in both themes; the 150% tool row scrolls horizontally and some message metadata is outside the captured viewport.",
    "The collapsed image shows the compact title bar with expand and close controls. Some minimum captures have the hide button transparent until hover or keyboard focus, consistent with the existing quick-chat-hide CSS; those PNGs do not independently establish its hover/focus interaction.",
    "Both minimum save-error images show the complete two-line red Chinese storage error and dismiss action; the end image shows the blue keyboard outline above the notice."
  ],
